## Technical notes

- Single-file HTML (`index.html`)
- No build step. No framework. No JavaScript beyond minimal anchor scroll
- External dependencies: Google Fonts (Fraunces, Inter, JetBrains Mono) via `fonts.googleapis.com`
- Responsive down to mobile
- Print styles included for PDF export
- Deployed via GitHub Pages from `main` branch, root folder

